# Cursecloth Wrappings: "{T}: Target creature card in your graveyard gains embalm until end of turn. The embalm cost is equal to
# its mana cost" (CR 702.128a, 118.7, 611.2a). Bot1's Llanowar Elves ({G}, no embalm of its own) dies to a Lightning Bolt; the
# Wrappings gives it embalm, whose cost is exactly {G}, paid from Mox Emerald alone (nothing is left in the pool). The token is a
# white Druid Elf Zombie with no mana cost, and the Wrappings' "Zombies you control get +1/+1" makes it a 2/2.

